\title{owdata: Index of openwashdata R Data Packages}
\description{
owdata ships a harvested catalog of the openwashdata R data packages,
their datasets and their variables. The catalog is compiled into the
package as an internal snapshot and regenerated weekly by an automated
harvest of the openwashdata GitHub organization; \code{\link[=owd_refresh]{owd_refresh()}}
fetches the latest published snapshot without reinstalling.
}
\details{
The catalog is exposed through accessor functions rather than lazy
data objects, so the same names serve both the installed snapshot and
a refreshed one:
\itemize{
\item \code{\link[=owd_packages]{owd_packages()}}: one row per package, all tiers
\item \code{\link[=owd_datasets]{owd_datasets()}}: one row per dataset, candidate and catalogued tiers
\item \code{\link[=owd_variables]{owd_variables()}}: one row per documented variable
\item \code{\link[=owd_search]{owd_search()}}: regex search across all of the above
\item \code{\link[=owd_install]{owd_install()}}: install packages from the openwashdata R-universe
}

Machine-readable copies of the catalog ship in \verb{inst/extdata/} as CSV,
XLSX and a single catalog.json bundle.
}
